<P STYLE="text-align: center; font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><B>CleanCore
Solutions, Inc. Announces Planned Corporate Name Change to Zone Frontier Inc.</B> </P>




<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">HOUSTON, August 14, 2026 &mdash; CleanCore Solutions,
Inc. (NYSE American: ZONE) (the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;) today announced that it intends to change its corporate name from &ldquo;CleanCore
Solutions, Inc.&rdquo; to &ldquo;Zone Frontier Inc.&rdquo; The Company has submitted a Certificate of Amendment to its Amended and Restated
Articles of Incorporation for filing with the Nevada Secretary of State that specifies a delayed effective date, and the name change will
become effective at 5:00 p.m. Pacific Time on August 31, 2026.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Upon effectiveness of the name change, the Company&rsquo;s
common stock will continue to trade on the NYSE American under the ticker symbol &ldquo;ZONE.&rdquo; The name change will not affect the
rights of the Company&rsquo;s stockholders. No action is required by existing stockholders, and all outstanding stock certificates and book-entry
positions will remain valid.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&ldquo;Our rebrand to Zone Frontier reflects the
evolution of our business and strategic direction, as well as our commitment to developing next-generation data center campuses for the
world&rsquo;s leading AI and technology companies,&rdquo; said Tyler Hassen, Chief Executive Officer of ZONE. &ldquo;As we continue to
execute on our growth initiatives, we believe the new name better represents who we are today and where we are headed.&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company intends to file a Current Report on
Form 8-K with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission in connection with the name change upon the effectiveness of the Certificate
of Amendment.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company&rsquo;s new website is www.zonefrontier.com.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>About CleanCore Solutions, Inc.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">CleanCore Solutions, Inc. (NYSE American: ZONE)
is helping to build the critical infrastructure that powers the AI economy. Through a growing pipeline of projects, the Company aims to
help meet the increasing demand for compute capacity, power, and digital infrastructure required by the world&rsquo;s leading AI companies.
The Company expects to operate under the name Zone Frontier Inc. upon effectiveness of the name change.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

